1
00:00:03,825 --> 00:00:05,247
Imagine waking up one

2
00:00:05,247 --> 00:00:06,873
morning and realizing...

3
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:08,295
that now you can hear

4
00:00:08,295 --> 00:00:09,920
other people's thoughts.

5
00:00:10,120 --> 00:00:11,574
You look at your parents,

6
00:00:11,574 --> 00:00:13,378
and you hear their inner voice.

7
00:00:13,578 --> 00:00:14,741
You step outside,

8
00:00:14,741 --> 00:00:17,236
and suddenly you begin to understand

9
00:00:17,236 --> 00:00:19,801
what complete strangers are thinking.

10
00:00:20,001 --> 00:00:23,079
At first, it feels like a real superpower.

11
00:00:23,079 --> 00:00:26,011
But very quickly, you realize one thing.

12
00:00:26,211 --> 00:00:27,891
You can't turn it off.

13
00:00:28,641 --> 00:00:30,491
Day one. You go to school.

14
00:00:30,691 --> 00:00:33,059
The teacher is explaining a new topic,

15
00:00:33,059 --> 00:00:34,617
but instead of his words,

16
00:00:34,617 --> 00:00:36,119
your head is filled with

17
00:00:36,119 --> 00:00:37,746
your classmates' thoughts.

18
00:00:37,946 --> 00:00:40,076
One is thinking about the exam.

19
00:00:40,076 --> 00:00:41,690
Another dreams of going

20
00:00:41,690 --> 00:00:43,444
home as soon as possible.

21
00:00:43,644 --> 00:00:45,195
A third keeps replaying

22
00:00:45,195 --> 00:00:46,881
yesterday's conversation.

23
00:00:47,081 --> 00:00:48,233
You try to focus,

24
00:00:48,233 --> 00:00:51,213
but there are hundreds of voices around you.

25
00:00:51,413 --> 00:00:52,213
And suddenly,

26
00:00:52,213 --> 00:00:54,735
you hear a thought that makes you freeze.

27
00:00:55,235 --> 00:00:56,834
"I hope he never finds out

28
00:00:56,834 --> 00:00:58,557
what I really think of him."

29
00:00:59,307 --> 00:00:59,968
Day three.

30
00:00:59,968 --> 00:01:01,519
The whole world already

31
00:01:01,519 --> 00:01:03,205
knows about this ability.

32
00:01:03,405 --> 00:01:06,087
People start avoiding conversations.

33
00:01:06,287 --> 00:01:08,381
Friends fight over thoughts that no

34
00:01:08,381 --> 00:01:10,356
one would ever have heard before.

35
00:01:10,556 --> 00:01:13,266
Even an ordinary smile no longer means

36
00:01:13,266 --> 00:01:16,118
that a person is truly happy to see you.

37
00:01:16,318 --> 00:01:18,725
Thousands of videos appear online,

38
00:01:18,725 --> 00:01:20,530
from people talking about

39
00:01:20,530 --> 00:01:22,264
their unusual abilities.

40
00:01:22,464 --> 00:01:24,698
But no one knows why it happened.

41
00:01:25,448 --> 00:01:27,245
Day five. The world becomes

42
00:01:27,245 --> 00:01:28,642
completely different.

43
00:01:28,842 --> 00:01:30,725
Imagine that it's impossible

44
00:01:30,725 --> 00:01:32,676
to hide your true intentions.

45
00:01:32,876 --> 00:01:35,366
Politicians can't hide their thoughts.

46
00:01:35,566 --> 00:01:37,522
Sellers know what you want to buy.

47
00:01:37,522 --> 00:01:39,275
And your friends hear even the

48
00:01:39,275 --> 00:01:41,320
things you would never dare to say.

49
00:01:41,520 --> 00:01:44,444
It seems like now everyone will be honest.

50
00:01:44,444 --> 00:01:46,151
But along with the lies,

51
00:01:46,151 --> 00:01:47,786
privacy disappears too.

52
00:01:47,986 --> 00:01:48,617
After all,

53
00:01:48,617 --> 00:01:51,393
not every thought should be known to others.

54
00:01:52,143 --> 00:01:52,801
Day seven.

55
00:01:52,801 --> 00:01:54,610
You wake up and notice that

56
00:01:54,610 --> 00:01:56,553
for the first time in a week,

57
00:01:56,553 --> 00:01:58,239
there is complete silence.

58
00:01:58,439 --> 00:02:01,206
No more voices. No more thoughts.

59
00:02:01,406 --> 00:02:03,064
The ability is gone.

60
00:02:03,264 --> 00:02:05,365
But when you meet your best friend,

61
00:02:05,365 --> 00:02:06,775
you hear a voice again,

62
00:02:06,775 --> 00:02:08,186
right inside your head.

63
00:02:08,686 --> 00:02:10,393
"I know you've been hearing my

64
00:02:10,393 --> 00:02:12,157
thoughts this whole time, too."

65
00:02:12,657 --> 00:02:14,571
You look at him. He smiles.

66
00:02:14,771 --> 00:02:16,385
And then you realize...

67
00:02:16,385 --> 00:02:18,840
maybe this ability was no accident.

68
00:02:19,040 --> 00:02:20,263
Now answer me this.

69
00:02:20,263 --> 00:02:21,643
If you could read the

70
00:02:21,643 --> 00:02:23,482
thoughts of only one person,

71
00:02:23,482 --> 00:02:24,815
who would you choose?

72
00:02:25,015 --> 00:02:26,375
And most importantly...

73
00:02:26,375 --> 00:02:28,000
would you want to know what

74
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:29,745
that person thinks about you?

